      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Open Beta 1546 should resolve this by showing the system keyboard, though I personally would like the option to change the default keyboard view to the full view for consistency when moving between platforms, and because I really don't like the PICO system keyboard. (just saving the keyboard view across sessions should suffice)\n\nOnce it goes live (unless PICO has an open-beta branch I'm unaware of?) I'll test and report back if this is resolved.",
