      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has been resolved as of build 1552 by utilising the system keyboard.\n\nMy only remaining concern may be that it's not obvious that you have to click the box to type.\n\nMaybe a text \"Click to type\", or automatically open the system keyboard with the chatbox and close the chatbox when the system keyboard submits text. (but not if it's manually closed with B, to still allow switching views)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
